OL,3,AWhy the prime minister wants to talk
OL,4,Aabout Brexit again
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Brexit debate is back.
OL,8,FFor years, it felt like the only thing
OL,9,FWestminster talked about.
OL,11,FI have had a ringside seat at it all,
OL,12,Ffrom the Conservative election victory
OL,13,Fin 2015, with the party's promise in
OL,14,Fits manifesto that year to offer "a
OL,15,Fstraight in-out referendum on our
OL,16,Fmembership of the European Union by the
OL,17,Fend of 2017."
